== A. producer
PASS flag words read from the producers (0xC812 at 002CE086, 0x8036 at 00566939)
PASS only the Yes/No question's 0xC812 carries 0x800 :: {'002CDF20 Yes/No': '0xc812', '00566680 sort picker': '0x8036', '002CE370 notice 0x411a': '0x411a', '002CE370 notice 0x511a': '0x511a', '002CE370 notice 0x611a': '0x611a', '002CE370 notice 0x1411a': '0x1411a', '002CE370 notice 0x1511a': '0x1511a'}
== B. the list bit
PASS 0057C7C0 tests 0x800 and 0057C7CC sets list +0xE4 bit 0x80
PASS every list is built with +0xE4 |= 0x2000050 (bit 0x40 on, 0x80 off) (002D1643)
PASS 002D14E0 is the list constructor: 00244F50(0x150, 002D2DB0, 0)
