== D. 002D4330 places the hand pointer
PASS 002D4330 writes no field of the list (selection untouched) :: []
PASS 002D4330 ends in 00368360(list, &rec) (002D4557)
PASS 00368360 is the 022CBE30 pointer step (gate 0036836A)
== E. +0x40 bit 3
PASS constructor 002465F0 sets 0x80A (bits 1, 3, 11) at 00246653
PASS positive control: the immediate-set census finds 005668AA :: ['005668AA']
PASS immediate clears of +0x40 bit 3: 0024194E, 0056683A, 0057CAE9 only :: ['0024194E', '0056683A', '0057CAE9']
PASS the confirm window reaches 0057CAE9 after the cancel post (0057CAE4) and after an unclaimed pick (0057CBF9 jne)
PASS the Yes/No host answers every pick with 0 (002CE189 / 002CE193)
PASS the host closes itself only from id 2 once +0xD8 == 1 (002CE197 ... 002CE1BA)
== F. the outside closer
PASS 002CE2D0 destroys the host registered at [0209AC30]+0x2E8 unless its +0x7C bit 0x20 is set
PASS the Yes/No host registers itself in that slot (002CDF6C) and so does the notice host (002CE48A)
PASS 002CE2D0 is called from the license screens only: 0055C7EF, 0055D557, 0055D667, 0055D7C2, 0055F4B1 :: ['0055C7EF', '0055D557', '0055D667', '0055D7C2', '0055F4B1']
